{"source_passage_id": "HHS4867-L07-JOINT-RANGE-OF-MOTION-P0002-PASSAGE", "text": "Joint Range of Motion\n• the distance and direction a joint can move between the flexed position and the extended position\n• Each specific joint has a normal range of motion that is expressed in degrees.\n• Devices used for measuring ROM: goniometer, inclinometer\n• AROM: active range of motion\n• Patient moves the joint\n• AROM\nactively without any\nassistance\n• PROM: passive range of motion\n• PROM\n• Therapist moves the joint through the range of motion with no effort from the patient", "document_id": "HHS4867-L07-JOINT-RANGE-OF-MOTION", "document_title": "Lecture 7.2 - Joint Range of Motion", "source_file": "23 - 7.2 Joint Range of Motion 關節活動幅度測量.pdf", "source_page_ids": ["HHS4867-L07-JOINT-RANGE-OF-MOTION-P0002"], "source_pages": [{"source_page_id": "HHS4867-L07-JOINT-RANGE-OF-MOTION-P0002", "document_id": "HHS4867-L07-JOINT-RANGE-OF-MOTION", "document_title": "Lecture 7.2 - Joint Range of Motion", "source_file": "23 - 7.2 Joint Range of Motion 關節活動幅度測量.pdf", "page_number": 2, "page_number_type": "slide_number", "slide_number": 2, "pdf_page": 2, "formatted": "23 - 7.2 Joint Range of Motion 關節活動幅度測量.pdf, slide 2 (PDF p. 2)"}], "slide_number": 2, "section_ids": ["HHS4867-L07-JOINT-RANGE-OF-MOTION-P0002", "HHS4867-L07-JOINT-RANGE-OF-MOTION-PART00", "HHS4867-L07-JOINT-RANGE-OF-MOTION", "HHS4867-COURSE"], "section_path": ["HHS4867 - Functional Movement Science", "Lecture 7.2 - Joint Range of Motion", "Joint range-of-motion concepts", "Joint Range of Motion"], "content_type": "slide_text", "ocr_text": null, "status": "generated_not_verified", "verification_status": "generated_not_verified"}
